  "gotchas": [
    "Current limits are never logged. Everything here is compiled in; if anyone calls applyCurrentLimit() or toggleTorqueCurrentLimit() at runtime the log gives no way to detect it. Nothing does today.",
    "Per-motor <Name>/StatorCurrent and <Name>/SupplyCurrent are LEADER ONLY. For Intake Roller, Launcher and Launcher Tower the true draw is roughly double. BatteryLogger/Current/Mechanisms/* does include followers.",
    "BatteryLogger/Power is supply current times pack voltage, not a measured quantity, and it uses the PREVIOUS loop's voltage (Robot.robotPeriodic runs the scheduler before setBatteryVoltage).",
    "BatteryLogger/Energy/* is cumulative from enable and never resets. First-difference it for per-interval energy.",
    "Currents are absolute-value summed, so regeneration counts as consumption and braking a flywheel inflates the number.",
    "MotorConnected exists only for Turret, Launcher and Hood, and only checks the leader. A dead Launcher Front Right (16) or LauncherTower Back (18) is invisible.",
    "Scheduler/* values are in SECONDS, not milliseconds.",
    "Temperature signals update at 4 Hz but log at 50 Hz, so */Temp traces are stair-stepped. Do not differentiate them at loop rate.",
    "Swerve/State/* is logged from the 250 Hz odometry thread; everything else is 50 Hz."
  ]
